    {
        "content": "<p>Loogle <code>Polynomial.degree (?_ + ?_)</code> doesn't give me direct result. The first one would be a corollary from <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Polynomial.degree_add_eq_left_of_degree_lt#doc\">docs#Polynomial.degree_add_eq_left_of_degree_lt</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Polynomial.degree_add_eq_right_of_degree_lt#doc\">docs#Polynomial.degree_add_eq_right_of_degree_lt</a>, but we probably should add it</p>",
